+      "kind": "concept",
+      "title": "C0056 has separate ac and GOE obligations; current status unknown",
+      "statement": "DRAFT source-status concept, not a theorem verdict. The recovered C0056 intake asks for both weak-disorder infinite-volume ac spectrum on Z^3 and GOE local statistics of finite-volume restrictions. Bourgade's 2018 survey uses centered iid variance-one sites and periodic boxes. A September 23, 2026 primary manuscript claims purely ac nonzero spectral restriction for iid uniform[-1,1] disorder at each fixed sufficiently small positive coupling, on a fixed interval above -6 in d=3. That claim's mathematical review gates are not established in this packet, and its stated theorem does not establish GOE statistics. Current openness is UNKNOWN; keep the two obligations and the law normalization explicit.",
